# Local developer checkout

This workspace is a **local developer version** of the plugin, not a published npm install. Edit `src/` here and treat the running TUI as this tree.

## Live OpenCode database

When you need the real session / tool / file / timing store, use:

`.agentize/opencode/opencode.db`

That is the local agentize DB for this project. Do **not** open the global `~/.local/share/opencode/opencode.db` (or Windows equivalent) unless the user asks or the local file is missing.

- Read-only. Do not write, migrate, or vacuum it.
- Soft-fail if it is locked or absent (`present: false` / defaults). It is not an exception.
- Unit tests use temp fixtures (`test/helpers/sqlite.ts`). Do not point tests at this file.
